# docs/28 §3.2: the plug-in hint, left alone: after 5 s the Mac takes the offline memos.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
include home_mac.cpas
usb off
wait 1500
include memo.cpas
usb on
include work_mac.cpas
wait 300
shot hint  plugged in: 离线 1 条 → 这台 · Tab 不给
pull
shot held  a pull during the 5 s gets nothing: still 录1
wait 5200
shot gone  the hint is gone after 5 s: the hint bar is back
pull
press opt+m
press ,
shot taken  the work Mac took it: 设置 → 存储 says 1 kept
